s":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-84c46e135f53dd7e9c27","yaoci-q-7677fe94726e4128470f","yaoci-q-6b978b92b933e80b7bbb","yaoci-q-725c821248250976de1f"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-84c46e135f53dd7e9c27","source_order":[49,112,0],"order":8967}],"persons":[{"id":"yaoci-p0029","name":"管亥","evidence":["yaoci-q-f1a4ffeda37e369fdf0c","yaoci-q-84c46e135f53dd7e9c27"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yaoci-q-6b978b92b933e80b7bbb","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-5232761de5a10e89f6e8","layer":"original","quote":"融既得济，益奇贵慈。曰：“卿，吾之少友也","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":112,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"yaoci-q-725c821248250976de1f","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-5232761de5a10e89f6e8","layer":"original","quote":"事毕，还启其母。母曰：“我喜汝有以报孔北海也","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":112,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":44},{"id":"yaoci-q-7677fe94726e4128470f","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-921f88c33e3abe15ece6","layer":"original","quote":"备敛容答曰〖17〗：“孔北海知世间有刘备邪！”即遣精兵三千人，随慈。贼闻兵至，解围散走","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":138,"end":181},{"id":"yaoci-q-84c46e135f53dd7e9c27","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-921f88c33e3abe15ece6","layer":"original","quote":"遂到平原，说备曰：“慈，东莱之鄙人也〖13〗。与孔北海亲非骨肉，比非乡党〖14〗；特以名志相好〖15〗，有分灾共患之义。今管亥暴乱，北海被围；孤穷无援，危在旦夕！以君有仁义之名，能救人之急；故北海区区〖16〗，延颈恃仰，使慈冒白刃，突重围，从万死之中自托于君：惟君所以存之","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":136},{"id":"yaoci-q-f1a4ffeda37e369fdf0c","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-13a25bda996994d95edb","layer":"original","quote":"时融以黄巾寇暴，出屯都昌〖4〗，为贼管亥所围","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":5